---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 246;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Chain from an SBV rate hike to stock prices: higher policy rates, costlier bank funding, tighter credit, heavy borrowers squeezed, then lower P/E for rate-sensitive stocks.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>How a rate decision reaches a share price</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một quyết định lãi suất đi tới giá cổ phiếu như thế nào</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="56" width="158" height="170" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={99.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="99.0" y="116" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>SBV raises</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>NHNN tăng lãi suất</tspan></text>
      <text x="99.0" y="133" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>policy rates</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>điều hành</tspan></text>
      <text x="99.0" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Refinancing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tái cấp vốn</tspan></text>
      <text x="99.0" y="184" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>4% → 6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4% → 6%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="180" y1="141" x2="190" y2="141" class="ln" /><polygon points="198,141 189,136 189,146" class="ah" />
      <rect x="200" y="56" width="158" height="170" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={279.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="279.0" y="116" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Banks pay</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng huy</tspan></text>
      <text x="279.0" y="133" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>more for funds</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>động đắt hơn</tspan></text>
      <text x="279.0" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Cap on deposits under</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trần tiền gửi dưới</tspan></text>
      <text x="279.0" y="184" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>6 months raised to 6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>6 tháng lên 6%</tspan></text>
      <line x1="360" y1="141" x2="370" y2="141" class="ln" /><polygon points="378,141 369,136 369,146" class="ah" />
      <rect x="380" y="56" width="158" height="170" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="lock" x={459.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="459.0" y="116" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Credit gets</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tín dụng</tspan></text>
      <text x="459.0" y="133" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>tighter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thắt lại</tspan></text>
      <text x="459.0" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Loan rates up,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi vay tăng,</tspan></text>
      <text x="459.0" y="184" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>fewer new loans</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ít khoản vay mới</tspan></text>
      <line x1="540" y1="141" x2="550" y2="141" class="ln" /><polygon points="558,141 549,136 549,146" class="ah" />
      <rect x="560" y="56" width="158" height="170" rx="10" class="cardr" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={639.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="639.0" y="116" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Heavy borrowers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Người vay nhiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="133" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>feel it first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chịu trước</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Property, bond issuers,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất động sản, trái phiếu,</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="184" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>margin buyers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mua ký quỹ</tspan></text>
      <line x1="720" y1="141" x2="730" y2="141" class="ln" /><polygon points="738,141 729,136 729,146" class="ah" />
      <rect x="740" y="56" width="158" height="170" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={819.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="819.0" y="116" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Prices</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá được</tspan></text>
      <text x="819.0" y="133" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>reprice</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>định lại</tspan></text>
      <text x="819.0" y="166" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Lower P/E for</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>P/E thấp hơn ở nhóm</tspan></text>
      <text x="819.0" y="184" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>rate-sensitive stocks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhạy cảm lãi suất</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The deposit-rate cap of 6% for deposits under six months came in the same-day Decision 1812 (Vietnamese press, 25 October 2022). Decree 65 also tightened bond issuance from 16 September 2022.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trần lãi tiền gửi 6% cho kỳ hạn dưới 6 tháng nằm trong Quyết định 1812 cùng ngày (báo chí, 25/10/2022). Nghị định 65 cũng siết phát hành trái phiếu từ 16/9/2022.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetransmission figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
